#DQMH License Agreement

TL;DR
The Delacor Queued Message Handler (short: DQMHﾂｮ) Framework is a freely available reference design for LabVIEW.

The fee for DQMH mentioned in the license is 0 dollars and it can be used for free in commercial applications as long as the about・section of the application or its documentation mentions that it uses DQMH. Version 6.1 and later of the DQMH Framework has an example of an About Window in the palettes that you can use as a reference on the exact wording to use and be compliant with the license.

For the DQMH Framework, this license refers to the code provided with the official DQMH VI Package Configuration (.vipc) that gets installed via VIPM into the LabVIEW installation directory. This license does not refer to any modules you create for your individual use-case using the above-mentioned DQMH tools.

If you need to provide the DQMH Framework to others, share the corresponding .vipc. You can find all versions at dqmh.org/downloads.

If you would like a different license agreement than the one below, please contact us at info@dqmh.org.
Delacor Queued Message Handler (DQMH(R)) (Where (R) represents a registered trademark)

